---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import CTABanner from '../../components/CTABanner.astro';
import * as imgs from '../../data/images';
---

<Layout
  title="Expansion & Movement Joint Sealing | Simply Bespoke, North East England"
  description="Professional expansion and movement joint sealant services for commercial and residential buildings across the North East. Durable, flexible sealant application to specification."
>
  <section class="section section--navy exp-hero" aria-labelledby="exp-h1">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="exp-hero__grid">
        <div>
          <span class="eyebrow eyebrow--white">Commercial Service</span>
          <h1 id="exp-h1">Expansion &amp; Movement Joint Sealing</h1>
          <p>Professional expansion joint and movement joint sealant application for buildings of all types across the North East.</p>
          <div class="btn-group">
            <a href="/contact" class="btn btn--white">Request a Quote</a>
            <a href="/commercial" class="btn btn--outline-white">All Commercial Services</a>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="exp-hero__image">
          <img src={imgs.external[4]} alt="Expansion joint sealant application on a commercial building" loading="eager" />
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container container--narrow">
      <span class="eyebrow">Movement Joint Specialist</span>
      <h2>Expansion &amp; Movement Joint Sealant</h2>
      <div class="prose">
        <p>Expansion and movement joints are designed into buildings to accommodate thermal expansion, settlement and structural movement. Correctly sealing these joints is critical — the wrong sealant product, or poor application, will fail prematurely and compromise the performance of the joint.</p>
        <p>Simply Bespoke provides professional movement joint sealing services across the North East, using appropriate sealant products with the right movement capability, adhesion and durability for each specific application.</p>
        <h3>Movement Joint Services</h3>
        <ul>
          <li>Building expansion joint sealing</li>
          <li>Structural movement joint sealant</li>
          <li>Floor-to-wall and floor-to-floor movement joints</li>
          <li>Cladding panel and façade joint sealing</li>
          <li>Perimeter joint sealing at structural interfaces</li>
          <li>Failed joint sealant removal and replacement</li>
          <li>High-movement sealant applications</li>
        </ul>
        <h3>Product Selection</h3>
        <p>The correct sealant for a movement joint must accommodate the designed movement without adhesion failure or cohesive failure. We select sealant products based on the joint width, movement requirement, substrate type and environmental exposure — ensuring longevity and performance.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="btn-group">
        <a href="/contact" class="btn btn--primary">Request a Quote</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <CTABanner
    title="Movement Joint Sealant Across the North East"
    description="Professional expansion and movement joint sealing for commercial and residential developments. Simply Bespoke delivers high-quality results across the region."
    buttonText="Get in Touch"
  />
</Layout>

<style>
  .exp-hero { padding-block: clamp(4rem,7vw,7rem); }
  .exp-hero__grid {
    display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: clamp(3rem,5vw,5rem); align-items: center;
  }
  .exp-hero__image { aspect-ratio: 4/3; overflow: hidden; }
  .exp-hero__image img { width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; }

  @media (max-width: 767px) {
    .exp-hero__grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .exp-hero__image { order: -1; aspect-ratio: 16/9; }
  }
</style>
